; Upstream builds one library whose modules are all top level, and exposes
; five of them. Dune has no way to publish some modules of an unwrapped
; library and hide the rest, so all nine are visible here. In-tree consumers
; name Cmarkit, Cmarkit_renderer, Cmarkit_html and Cmarkit_commonmark only.

(library
 (name cmarkit)
 (public_name cmarkit)
 (wrapped false))
